    "Security may retain a revisioned research relationship among exact vulnerability/sample identities, external/provider claims, independent evidence, private materialization state and execution admission without cloning provider databases or storing Sample bytes in Git.",
    "Sample possession or SampleVault materialization does not grant execution authority.",
    "Provider malware/vulnerability classifications remain provider claims unless separately supported by Security-owned evidence.",
